WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.471 --> 00:00:05.250
Help is at the bottom of the sidebar. It has the articles, the glossary and the blog.

2
00:00:05.953 --> 00:00:13.228
Type in Search the help articles to find an answer. Here, budget finds the articles and glossary words that mention it.

3
00:00:13.926 --> 00:00:17.937
Open a result to read the article, with its sections listed on the right.

4
00:00:18.642 --> 00:00:23.613
The Glossary explains the words of Guildwise HQ, from allow-list to workstation.

5
00:00:24.312 --> 00:00:27.085
What’s new lists the latest changes, newest first.

6
00:00:30.532 --> 00:00:35.204
And the Blog tab has articles from the team on AI agents and automation.

7
00:00:35.907 --> 00:00:41.112
On any page, the question mark in the top bar explains what is on the page behind it.

8
00:00:41.812 --> 00:00:46.740
And on the Help centre, you can take or replay the guided tour of the sidebar at any time.

9
00:00:47.439 --> 00:00:51.087
That is Help. Search first, and replay the tour whenever you like.
